# JRebirth

Before creating or changing JRebirth/JavaFX application code:

1. Follow root `AGENTS.md` (MVC split, JAT rules, Waves, naming).
2. Open the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/jrebirth-*/SKILL.md` (or `skills/` if this kit is opened directly).
3. Prefer JRebirth roles over plain JavaFX shortcuts (`Platform.runLater`, raw threads, logic in controllers).

Start with `jrebirth-core` when the role is unclear; use `jrebirth-create-mvc` for a full screen.
